on, Diversity, and Coverage. A comparative analysis is carried out with existing news recommendation systems and this result shows that the proposed news recommendation system achieves 93.6 % precision, 92. % recall, and 92.9% F1 score values. This result shows that the superiority of proposed news recommendation approach and this would be able to provide highest accuracy value, which is nearly 97.5%. © 2025 The Authors. Published by AnaPub Publications. This is an open access article under the CC BY-NC-ND license. (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/)},
